lic-domain","language":"zh","tags":["道家","想象"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"acb666edc7b26d87","text":"宠辱不惊，闲看庭前花开花落；去留无意，漫随天外云卷云舒。","category":"book","work":"菜根谭","author":"洪应明","speaker":"","location":"修身篇","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/菜根譚","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["处世","心境"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"1f11c79f7579db89","text":"三人行，必有我师焉；择其善者而从之，其不善者而改之。","category":"book","work":"论语","author":"孔子及其弟子","speaker":"","location":"述而第七","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/論語/述而第七","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["儒家","学习"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"2f8d501842f3585a","text":"温故而知新，可以为师矣。","category":"book","work":"论语","author":"孔子及其弟子","speaker":"","location":"为政第二","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/論語/為政第二","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["儒家","学习"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"c435effeb5ba433d","text":"学而时习之，不亦说乎？有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎？","category":"book","work":"论语","author":"孔子及其弟子","speaker":"","location":"学而第一","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/論語/學而第一","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["儒家","经典"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"3636bad3be6d1c47","text":"千里之行，始于足下。","category":"book","work":"道德经","author":"老子","speaker":"","location":"第六十四章","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/道德經","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["道家","行动"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"44d9a94ddb9f5b4a","text":"上善若水。水善利万物而不争。","category":"book","work":"道德经","author":"老子","speaker":"","location":"第八章","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/道德經","license":"public-domain","language":"zh","tags":["道家","经典"],"retrieved_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:00+08:00","verified":true},{"id":"9c8a7f4d24adaab3","text":"Talk is cheap. Show me the code.",